---
title: Markdown Directive Handler Pattern
---
classDiagram
    namespace galaxy_managers_markdown_util {
        class GalaxyInternalMarkdownDirectiveHandler {
            <<abstract>>
            +trans
            +export_markdown_directive()
            handle_dataset_display()*
            handle_dataset_as_image()*
            handle_dataset_as_table()*
            handle_workflow_display()*
            handle_job_metrics()*
            ...()
        }
        class ReadyForExportMarkdownDirectiveHandler {
            +extra_rendering_data: dict
        }
        class ToBasicMarkdownDirectiveHandler
    }


    note for GalaxyInternalMarkdownDirectiveHandler "Abstract base defines<br>directive handling interface"
    note for ReadyForExportMarkdownDirectiveHandler "Lazy expansion:<br>Collects metadata<br>Preserves directives<br>For frontend rendering<br><br>Used by: Frontend UI<br>Returns: JSON metadata"
    note for ToBasicMarkdownDirectiveHandler "Eager expansion:<br>Fully expands directives<br>Tables, images, text<br>For PDF export<br><br>Used by: PDF export<br>Returns: Standard markdown"

    GalaxyInternalMarkdownDirectiveHandler <|-- ReadyForExportMarkdownDirectiveHandler
    GalaxyInternalMarkdownDirectiveHandler <|-- ToBasicMarkdownDirectiveHandler
